articles.text:
nshingano akoresheje uburyo
bw’ikoranabuhanga, agaragaza –
(a) izina rye ryanditswe mu nyandiko
y’ivuka;
(b) izina asaba kwitwa;
(c) impamvu zituma asaba guhindura
izina;
(d) aho atuye mu Rwanda harimo
Umudugudu, Akagari, Umurenge,
Akarere n’Intara cyangwa Umujyi
wa Kigali;
(e) aho atuye mu mahanga, iyo atuye
hanze y’Igihugu;
(f) inomero ya telefoni abarizwaho;
(g) amazina y’ababyeyi be;
(h) itariki y’amavuko n’aho yavukiye;
(i) n’izina ry’uwo bashakanye, iyo
ubusabe bwo guhindura izina
bushingiye ku ishyingirwa.
(2) Iyo uhindura izina ari umwana, gusaba
guhindura izina bikorwa n’ababyeyi be
cyangwa undi umufiteho ububasha bwa
kibyeyi.
